      "title": "Krea 2 Reference Stack Encoder V10 (POSITIVE) - single identity reference, pose driven entirely by prompt",
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "KGTextEncodeKreaImageReferencesV10"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Anime mascot portrait of exactly the same adult woman as the identity reference. Preserve her recognizable identity, facial features, hair color, eye color, skin tone and inverted bob hairstyle. She is wearing a clearly visible plain WHITE CREW-NECK T-SHIRT with short sleeves, opaque white cotton fabric, a high round neckline at the base of her neck, covered chest and covered shoulders. The white T-shirt is an essential, prominent part of the image. Both sleeves, the round collar and white fabric across her upper torso are visible. No strapless top, no bare shoulders, no cleavage. Keep the existing refined modern anime/mascot style, soft cel shading, bold clean outlines, vibrant saturated colors and polished rendering. Her eyes are noticeably larger and rounder than in the reference: big, wide-open, expressive anime eyes with enlarged blue irises, bright highlights and clearly visible whites. Enlarge the complete eye shape and opening, not only the pupils, while keeping her recognizable facial identity and adult proportions. She has a charming warm smile and looks directly at the viewer, with her head turned slightly toward the viewer's left. Upper-body composition including her entire head, shoulders, both arms and both hands. Both hands are raised together in front of her white T-shirt at chest level, making one clearly recognizable heart shape: index fingertips meet at the top and thumb tips meet at the bottom, enclosing an open heart-shaped space. Natural wrists and anatomically coherent fingers. Both hands and the complete heart gesture are clearly visible, unobstructed, below her face. She holds a small colorful swirled lollipop in her mouth: the candy is partly between her lips, with a short white stick clearly protruding diagonally from one corner of her mouth. Her lips gently hold the lollipop, with a playful smiling expression. The lollipop is held only by her mouth. Both hands remain empty and dedicated to the complete heart gesture, away from the lollipop. Solid colorful sky-blue background, evenly filled from edge to edge, no white background, no white border, no scenery. Landscape composition with a 63:50 aspect ratio, delivered at 630x500 pixels. Center the character with comfortable colored breathing room above her hair and on both sides. Zoom out sufficiently to include the entire top of her hair with a clearly visible blue margin above it, the white T-shirt neckline, both covered shoulders and the upper torso. Keep the entire head, hair, shoulders and both hands safely within the frame; do not crop the heart gesture or fingers. Frame wide enough to show the upper torso and the complete gesture clearly while keeping the face prominent and readable at small sizes. Exactly one character, no other people, no text, no logo, no watermark.",
        1.2,
        "artist friendly - soft at low values",
        "medium - balanced default (384)",
        "keep full image shape",
        "smart per-card timing",
        0.4,
        "gentle guard - keep my prompt words",
        "off - use my values",
        "reuse between runs - faster tuning"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
